    "featured-event": "<section class=\"home-feature\"><a class=\"home-poster\" href=\"images/events/2026-laura-young/poster.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"images/events/2026-laura-young/poster.jpg\" alt=\"与 Laura Wen-yu Young 对谈\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><div><p class=\"home-eyebrow\">近期回顾</p><h2>与 Laura Wen-yu Young 对谈</h2><p>大同学社与东亚图书馆共同举办 Laura Wen-yu Young（Wang and Wang, LLP）对谈，活动包含嘉宾分享与开放讨论。</p><p><time datetime=\"2026-10-21T19:00:00-07:00\">Oct 21, 2026 · 07:00 PM · Pacific Time</time><br>伯克利 C. V. Starr 东亚图书馆 · 341 研讨室</p><a class=\"button\" href=\"images/events/2026-laura-young/poster.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">查看活动海报 ↗</a></div></section>",
    "event-programs": "<section class=\"home-feature\"><div><p class=\"home-eyebrow\">近期回顾</p><h2>与 Laura Wen-yu Young 对谈</h2><p>大同学社与东亚图书馆共同举办 Laura Wen-yu Young（Wang and Wang, LLP）对谈，活动包含嘉宾分享与开放讨论。</p><p><time datetime=\"2026-10-21T19:00:00-07:00\">Oct 21, 2026 · 07:00 PM · Pacific Time</time><br>伯克利 C. V. Starr 东亚图书馆 · 341 研讨室</p><a class=\"button\" href=\"images/events/2026-laura-young/poster.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">查看活动海报 ↗</a></div></section><section class=\"home-feature\"><div><p class=\"home-eyebrow\">近期回顾</p><h2>KŪKAI 空海 — 放映与对谈</h2><p>纪录片讲述空海自日本赴唐的旅程，并与导演岳野在线对谈。由 C. V. Starr 东亚图书馆、大同学社与 Deep Value 合办。文言旁白，英文字幕，片长 97 分钟。</p><p><time datetime=\"2026-10-12T18:30:00-07:00\">Oct 12, 2026 · 06:30 PM · Pacific Time</time><br>伯克利 Anthropology &amp; Art Practice Building · 160 教室</p><a class=\"button\" href=\"images/events/2026-kukai/poster.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">查看活动海报 ↗</a></div></section>",
    "campus-links": "<section class=\"resource-directory\"><h3>伯克利学生与研究者常用链接</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.lib.berkeley.edu/visit/east-asian\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">C. V. Starr 东亚图书馆 ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://guides.lib.berkeley.edu/az/databases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">伯克利图书馆数据库 ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://ieas.berkeley.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">东亚研究所（IEAS） ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://ieas.berkeley.edu/centers/center-chinese-studies-ccs/useful-links-ccs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">中国研究中心 — 资源链接 ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://ieas.berkeley.edu/ieas-home/fellowships-grants/undergraduate-students\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">IEAS 本科研究奖项与资助 ↗</a></li></ul></section>",
    "workshop-schedule": "<h2>2026 年秋季</h2><section class=\"workshop-session\"><p class=\"home-eyebrow\"><time datetime=\"2026-10-08\">2026-10-08</time> · 往期讨论</p><h3>中国林业：森林与环境改造的政治</h3><p class=\"workshop-speaker\">主讲人: Weiran Zhu, UC Berkeley</p><p>从毁林与造林的关系切入，讨论林业劳动的组织，以及局部案例如何修正更广泛的历史解释。</p><details><summary>讨论问题</summary><ul><li>具体林业项目中的“征服自然”意味着什么？</li><li>专业知识、行政目标与日常需求如何相互作用？</li><li>局部案例与总体历史解释之间需要怎样的证据？</li></ul></details></section><section class=\"workshop-session\"><p class=\"home-eyebrow\"><time datetime=\"2026-10-15\">2026-10-15</time> · 往期讨论</p><h3>中国宪法：制度形成与政治实践</h3><p class=\"workshop-speaker\">主讲人: Xin Wen, UC Berkeley, School of Law</p><p class=\"workshop-meta\">晚 7–8 点 · 太平洋时间<br>EAL Meeting Room（东亚图书馆会议室）</p><p>从政治发生学的视角，初步理解中国宪法在做什么，并以 Dual State 模型作为讨论的起点。</p></section><section class=\"workshop-session\"><p class=\"home-eyebrow\"><time datetime=\"2026-10-21\">2026-10-21</time> · 往期讨论</p><h3>与 Laura Wen-yu Young 对谈</h3><p class=\"workshop-speaker\">主讲人: Laura Wen-yu Young, Wang and Wang, LLP</p><p class=\"workshop-meta\">晚 7–8 点 · 太平洋时间<br>伯克利 C. V. Starr 东亚图书馆 · 341 研讨室</p><p>围绕法律教育与职业经历的轻松对谈，嘉宾分享后开放讨论。</p></section><section class=\"workshop-session\"><p class=\"home-eyebrow\"><time datetime=\"2026-10-29\">2026-10-29</time> · 往期讨论</p><h3>形而上学：道家、亚里士多德、康德与卡夫卡</h3><p class=\"workshop-speaker\">主讲人: Odradek Zhang, UC Berkeley</p><p>具体安排将后续公布。</p></section><section class=\"workshop-session\"><p class=\"home-eyebrow\"><time datetime=\"2026-11-05\">2026-11-05</time> · 近期安排</p><h3>主题待定</h3><p>具体安排将后续公布。</p></section><section class=\"workshop-session\"><p class=\"home-eyebrow\"><time datetime=\"2026-11-12\">2026-11-12</time> · 近期安排</p><h3>明清的戏曲与优伶文化</h3><p class=\"workshop-speaker\">主讲人: David Gong, UC Berkeley</p><p>具体安排将后续公布。</p></section>",
    "laura-photos": "<section class=\"event-card\" data-cat=\"Community\"><div class=\"event-head\"><h3>10 月 21 日 · 与 Laura Wen-yu Young 对谈</h3><p>活动合影，摄于伯克利 C. V. Starr 东亚图书馆。</p></div><div class=\"event-gallery\"><a href=\"images/events/2026-laura-young/group-seminar-room.jpg\" data-cap=\"活动合影，摄于伯克利 C. V. Starr 东亚图书馆。\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/events/2026-laura-young/group-seminar-room.jpg\" alt=\"活动合影，摄于伯克利 C. V. Starr 东亚图书馆。\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2026-laura-young/group-library.jpg\" data-cap=\"活动合影，摄于伯克利 C. V. Starr 东亚图书馆。\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/events/2026-laura-young/group-library.jpg\" alt=\"活动合影，摄于伯克利 C. V. Starr 东亚图书馆。\"></a></div></section>",
    "kukai-photos": "<section class=\"event-card\" data-cat=\"Film &amp; Panel\"><div class=\"event-head\"><h3>10 月 12 日 · KŪKAI 空海 — 放映与对谈</h3><p>摄影：Siche、Weiran。</p></div><div class=\"event-gallery\"><a href=\"images/events/2026-kukai/screening.jpg\" data-cap=\"放映现场 · Siche\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/events/2026-kukai/screening.jpg\" alt=\"放映现场 · Siche\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2026-kukai/stage.jpg\" data-cap=\"伯克利活动现场 · Weiran\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/events/2026-kukai/stage.jpg\" alt=\"伯克利活动现场 · Weiran\"></a></div></section>",
