    "public-event-archive": "<div class=\"archive-controls\"><div id=\"public-events-filter\" aria-label=\"全部类型\"><button type=\"button\" data-filter=\"all\" class=\"is-active\" aria-pressed=\"true\">全部类型</button><button type=\"button\" data-filter=\"Film &amp; Panel\" aria-pressed=\"false\">电影与映后</button><button type=\"button\" data-filter=\"Author Talk\" aria-pressed=\"false\">作家对谈</button><button type=\"button\" data-filter=\"Lecture\" aria-pressed=\"false\">讲座</button><button type=\"button\" data-filter=\"Exhibition\" aria-pressed=\"false\">展览</button><button type=\"button\" data-filter=\"Field Trip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">参访</button><button type=\"button\" data-filter=\"Salon\" aria-pressed=\"false\">沙龙</button></div><label class=\"archive-year-select\">年份<select id=\"event-year\"><option value=\"all\">全部年份</option><option>2026</option><option>2025</option><option>2024</option><option>2023</option><option>2021</option><option>2020</option><option>2019</option><option>2017</option><option>2016</option></select></label></div><p class=\"archive-count\" id=\"event-count\" aria-live=\"polite\">19 场活动</p><p id=\"events-empty\" hidden>暂无符合筛选条件的活动。</p><section class=\"archive-year\" data-year=\"2026\"><h2 class=\"archive-year-heading\">2026</h2><article class=\"event-card public-event\" id=\"2026-laura-young\" data-cat=\"Lecture\" data-year=\"2026\"><div class=\"public-event-layout\"><figure class=\"event-cover\"><img src=\"images/events/2026-laura-young/poster.jpg\" alt=\"原活动海报\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>原活动海报</figcaption></figure><div class=\"public-event-copy\"><div class=\"event-meta\"><time datetime=\"2026-10\">2026年10月</time><span class=\"event-tag\">讲座</span></div><h3>与 Laura Wen-yu Young 对谈</h3><p class=\"event-people\">大同学社 · 东亚图书馆</p><p class=\"event-desc\">大同学社与东亚图书馆共同举办 Laura Wen-yu Young（Wang and Wang, LLP）对谈，活动包含嘉宾分享与开放讨论。</p></div></div><details class=\"event-details\"><summary>展开详情与图片</summary><div class=\"event-details-content\"><h4>活动与档案影像</h4><div class=\"event-gallery\"><a href=\"images/events/2026-laura-young/group-seminar-room.jpg\" data-cap=\"研讨室合影\"><img src=\"images/events/2026-laura-young/group-seminar-room.jpg\" alt=\"研讨室合影\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2026-laura-young/group-library.jpg\" data-cap=\"东亚图书馆合影\"><img src=\"images/events/2026-laura-young/group-library.jpg\" alt=\"东亚图书馆合影\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div></div></details></article><article class=\"event-card public-event\" id=\"2026-kukai\" data-cat=\"Film &amp; Panel\" data-year=\"2026\"><div class=\"public-event-layout\"><figure class=\"event-cover\"><img src=\"images/events/2026-kukai/poster.jpg\" alt=\"原活动海报\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>原活动海报</figcaption></figure><div class=\"public-event-copy\"><div class=\"event-meta\"><time datetime=\"2026-10\">2026年10月</time><span class=\"event-tag\">电影与映后</span></div><h3>KŪKAI 空海 — 放映与对谈</h3><p class=\"event-people\">大同学社 · 东亚图书馆</p><p class=\"event-desc\">纪录片讲述空海自日本赴唐的旅程，并与导演岳野在线对谈。由 C. V. Starr 东亚图书馆、大同学社与 Deep Value 合办。文言旁白，英文字幕，片长 97 分钟。</p></div></div><details class=\"event-details\"><summary>展开详情与图片</summary><div class=\"event-details-content\"><h4>活动与档案影像</h4><div class=\"event-gallery\"><a href=\"images/events/2026-kukai/screening.jpg\" data-cap=\"放映现场 · Siche 摄\"><img src=\"images/events/2026-kukai/screening.jpg\" alt=\"放映现场 · Siche 摄\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2026-kukai/stage.jpg\" data-cap=\"伯克利对谈现场 · Weiran 摄\"><img src=\"images/events/2026-kukai/stage.jpg\" alt=\"伯克利对谈现场 · Weiran 摄\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div></div></details></article></section><section class=\"archive-year\" data-year=\"2025\"><h2 class=\"archive-year-heading\">2025</h2><article class=\"event-card public-event\" id=\"2025-immigration-rights\" data-cat=\"Lecture\" data-year=\"2025\"><div class=\"public-event-layout\"><figure class=\"event-cover\"><img src=\"images/events/2025-immigration-rights/poster-en.jpg\" alt=\"原英文活动海报 · 2025 年 4 月\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>原英文活动海报 · 2025 年 4 月</figcaption></figure><div class=\"public-event-copy\"><div class=\"event-meta\"><time datetime=\"2025-04\">2025年4月</time><span class=\"event-tag\">讲座</span></div><h3>移民权益讲座</h3><p class=\"event-people\">Zachary M. Nightingale · Olivia Serene Lee · Vincent Pan</p><p class=\"event-desc\">围绕 F-1 签证撤销及移民社群面临的实际问题，活动预告安排了移民律师讲解、社群资源介绍与现场问答。</p></div></div><details class=\"event-details\"><summary>展开详情与图片</summary><div class=\"event-details-content\"><p>议程涵盖 2025 年的签证动态、与执法人员互动及出行相关问题，预告嘉宾包括移民律师与非营利机构负责人。此条目记录当时的活动议程。</p><h4>活动与档案影像</h4><div class=\"event-gallery\"><a href=\"images/events/2025-immigration-rights/poster-zh.jpg\" data-cap=\"原中文活动海报\"><img src=\"images/events/2025-immigration-rights/poster-zh.jpg\" alt=\"原中文活动海报\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div></div></details></article><article class=\"event-card public-event\" id=\"2025-perry-link\" data-cat=\"Lecture\" data-year=\"2025\"><div class=\"public-event-layout public-event-text-only\"><div class=\"public-event-copy\"><div class=\"event-meta\"><time datetime=\"2025-01\">2025年1月</time><span class=\"event-tag\">讲座</span></div><h3>与林培瑞对谈</h3><p class=\"event-desc\">林培瑞与大同学社围绕极权、人性与对策展开分享和讨论。</p></div></div><details class=\"event-details\"><summary>展开详情</summary><div class=\"event-details-content\"><p>同学与社友借此与林培瑞交流、提问。</p></div></details></article></section><section class=\"archive-year\" data-year=\"2024\"><h2 class=\"archive-year-heading\">2024</h2><article class=\"event-card public-event\" id=\"2024-jiang-xue-li-sipan\" data-cat=\"Lecture\" data-year=\"2024\"><div class=\"public-event-layout public-event-text-only\"><div class=\"public-event-copy\"><div class=\"event-meta\"><time datetime=\"2024-04\">2024年4月</time><span class=\"event-tag\">讲座</span></div><h3>与江雪、李思磐对谈</h3><p class=\"event-desc\">与媒体人江雪、李思磐线上对谈，讨论新闻工作、职业身份转变及社会变迁中的个人选择。</p></div></div><details class=\"event-details\"><summary>展开详情</summary><div class=\"event-details-content\"><p>活动预告围绕从市场化媒体记者、编辑走向独立媒体人、女权主义者及社会研究者的经历，讨论个人选择与时代背景之间的关系。</p></div></details></article><article class=\"event-card public-event\" id=\"2024-geling-yan\" data-cat=\"Author Talk\" data-year=\"2024\"><div class=\"public-event-layout\"><figure class=\"event-cover\"><img src=\"images/events/2023-author-talk-geling-yan/cover.jpg\" alt=\"严歌苓在伯克利与读者交流\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>严歌苓在伯克利与读者交流</figcaption></figure><div class=\"public-event-copy\"><div class=\"event-meta\"><time datetime=\"2024-04\">2024年4月</time><span class=\"event-tag\">作家对谈</span></div><h3>与严歌苓面对面：《米拉蒂》新书分享会</h3><p class=\"event-people\">嘉宾：严歌苓</p><p class=\"event-desc\">严歌苓来到伯克利，与同学及湾区中文读者分享新作《米拉蒂》，并在问答与签售中继续交流。</p></div></div><details class=\"event-details\"><summary>展开详情与图片</summary><div class=\"event-details-content\"><p>《米拉蒂》以八十年代的文化与思想变动为背景，书写一位年轻女性从文工团舞者走向独立写作的经历。分享围绕小说中的人物与时代展开，也介绍了严歌苓在海外创作、出版这部作品的过程。</p><p>活动分为作家分享、观众问答与新书签售三个环节，以普通话进行，由大同学社组织，为校园与湾区读者提供了与作者面对面交流的机会。</p><h4>活动与档案影像</h4><div class=\"event-gallery\"><a href=\"images/events/2023-author-talk-geling-yan/01.jpg\" data-cap=\"分享会后合影\"><img src=\"images/events/2023-author-talk-geling-yan/01.jpg\" alt=\"分享会后合影\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2023-author-talk-geling-yan/02.jpg\" data-cap=\"新书分享会观众\"><img src=\"images/events/2023-author-talk-geling-yan/02.jpg\" alt=\"新书分享会观众\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2023-author-talk-geling-yan/03.jpg\" data-cap=\"原档案中的作家宣传照\"><img src=\"images/events/2023-author-talk-geling-yan/03.jpg\" alt=\"原档案中的作家宣传照\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div></div></details></article><article class=\"event-card public-event\" id=\"2024-wu-guoguang\" data-cat=\"Lecture\" data-year=\"2024\"><div class=\"public-event-layout public-event-text-only\"><div class=\"public-event-copy\"><div class=\"event-meta\"><time datetime=\"2024-02\">2024年2月</time><span class=\"event-tag\">讲座</span></div><h3>与学者吴国光漫谈</h3><p class=\"event-desc\">大同学社与学者吴国光漫谈，为同学提供提问与交流的空间。</p></div></div><details class=\"event-details\"><summary>展开详情</summary><div class=\"event-details-content\"><p>活动以嘉宾与参与者之间的开放交流为主要形式。</p></div></details></article></section><section class=\"archive-year\" data-year=\"2023\"><h2 class=\"archive-year-heading\">2023</h2><article class=\"event-card public-event\" id=\"2023-qin-hui\" data-cat=\"Lecture\" data-year=\"2023\"><div class=\"public-event-layout public-event-text-only\"><div class=\"public-event-copy\"><div class=\"event-meta\"><time datetime=\"2023-11\">2023年11月</time><span class=\"event-tag\">讲座</span></div><h3>秦晖：从流脑大疫到“合作医疗”</h3><p class=\"event-desc\">历史学者秦晖以“从流脑大疫到‘合作医疗’：文革时期的中国农村卫生事业”为题，讨论这一时期的农村公共卫生。</p></div></div><details class=\"event-details\"><summary>展开详情</summary><div class=\"event-details-content\"><p>讲座以普通话为主，围绕农村医疗卫生的历史展开。</p></div></details></article><article class=\"event-card public-event\" id=\"2023-piano-in-a-factory\" data-cat=\"Film &amp; Panel\" data-year=\"2023\"><div class=\"public-event-layout\"><figure class=\"event-cover\"><img src=\"images/events/2023-piano-in-a-factory/film.jpg\" alt=\"原活动推文中保存的影片宣传图\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>原活动推文中保存的影片宣传图</figcaption></figure><div class=\"public-event-copy\"><div class=\"event-meta\"><time datetime=\"2023-11\">2023年11月</time><span class=\"event-tag\">电影与映后</span></div><h3>《钢的琴》：电影展映与学者讨论</h3><p class=\"event-people\">嘉宾：Kevin O’Brien（欧博文）、林溪瀛（Lillian）</p><p class=\"event-desc\">从张猛导演的《钢的琴》出发，讨论东北的工业转型、下岗工人的生活，以及个体如何面对时代变动。</p></div></div><details class=\"event-details\"><summary>展开详情</summary><div class=\"event-details-content\"><p>影片以上世纪九十年代下岗潮中的东北为背景，讲述原钢厂工人陈桂林为女儿制作钢琴的故事。亲情、友谊与旧工厂交织在一起，呈现工人生活在经济与社会转型中的变化。</p><p>映后讨论邀请伯克利政治学者欧博文与历史系博士生林溪瀛参加。两位嘉宾都与东北有着个人或任教经历上的联系，围绕影片及其所处的社会背景与观众交流。影片为中文、英文字幕，映后讨论使用英语。</p></div></details></article><article class=\"event-card public-event\" id=\"2023-film-panorama\" data-cat=\"Film &amp; Panel\" data-year=\"2023\"><div class=\"public-event-layout public-event-text-only\"><div class=\"public-event-copy\"><div class=\"event-meta\"><time datetime=\"2023-04\">2023年4月</time><span class=\"event-tag\">电影与映后</span></div><h3>2023 短片展映 · 大同 × IMFF</h3><p class=\"event-desc\">大同学社与 In Moments Film Festival（IMFF）联合推出三部短片的展映活动。</p></div></div><details class=\"event-details\"><summary>展开详情</summary><div class=\"event-details-content\"><p>公布片目包括秦飞凯的《越南公婆上巴黎》、胡英海的《沙巢》及李家和的《地儿》。</p></div></details></article><article class=\"event-card public-event\" id=\"2023-keliang-zhu\" data-cat=\"Lecture\" data-year=\"2023\"><div class=\"public-event-layout\"><figure class=\"event-cover\"><img src=\"images/events/2023-lecture-zhukeliang-wechat-lawsuit/01.jpg\" alt=\"伯克利讲座现场\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>伯克利讲座现场</figcaption></figure><div class=\"public-event-copy\"><div class=\"event-meta\"><time datetime=\"2023-04\">2023年4月</time><span class=\"event-tag\">讲座</span></div><h3>在美华人诉美国总统：朱可亮谈微信诉讼</h3><p class=\"event-people\">嘉宾：朱可亮律师</p><p class=\"event-desc\">朱可亮律师分享美国微信用户挑战2020年微信禁令的来龙去脉、诉讼策略，以及这一案件对华人社群维权的启示。</p></div></div><details class=\"event-details\"><summary>展开详情与图片</summary><div class=\"event-details-content\"><p>朱可亮结合参与诉讼的经历，介绍案件如何发起、推进，以及律师团队采取的法律策略。讲座从一个具体案件延伸至法律行动与公共参与，讨论华人社群如何通过司法途径维护自身权益。</p><p>本场活动是大同中文讲座系列的一部分，以普通话进行，包含嘉宾分享与观众问答。学生与社区观众在现场交流，共同讨论法律行动与公共参与。</p><h4>活动与档案影像</h4><div class=\"event-gallery\"><a href=\"images/events/2023-lecture-zhukeliang-wechat-lawsuit/02.jpg\" data-cap=\"观众交流\"><img src=\"images/events/2023-lecture-zhukeliang-wechat-lawsuit/02.jpg\" alt=\"观众交流\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2023-lecture-zhukeliang-wechat-lawsuit/03.jpg\" data-cap=\"现场提问\"><img src=\"images/events/2023-lecture-zhukeliang-wechat-lawsuit/03.jpg\" alt=\"现场提问\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2023-lecture-zhukeliang-wechat-lawsuit/04.jpg\" data-cap=\"活动现场\"><img src=\"images/events/2023-lecture-zhukeliang-wechat-lawsuit/04.jpg\" alt=\"活动现场\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2023-lecture-zhukeliang-wechat-lawsuit/06.jpg\" data-cap=\"活动现场\"><img src=\"images/events/2023-lecture-zhukeliang-wechat-lawsuit/06.jpg\" alt=\"活动现场\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2023-lecture-zhukeliang-wechat-lawsuit/cover.jpg\" data-cap=\"朱可亮律师分享\"><img src=\"images/events/2023-lecture-zhukeliang-wechat-lawsuit/cover.jpg\" alt=\"朱可亮律师分享\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div></div></details></article><article class=\"event-card public-event\" id=\"2023-still-life\" data-cat=\"Film &amp; Panel\" data-year=\"2023\"><div class=\"public-event-layout\"><figure class=\"event-cover\"><img src=\"images/events/film-still-life-screening/cover.jpg\" alt=\"何伟通过 Zoom 参加映后讨论\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>何伟通过 Zoom 参加映后讨论</figcaption></figure><div class=\"public-event-copy\"><div class=\"event-meta\"><time datetime=\"2023-02\">2023年2月</time><span class=\"event-tag\">电影与映后</span></div><h3>《三峡好人》：与何伟、Andrew F. Jones 映后交流</h3><p class=\"event-people\">何伟（线上）· Andrew F. Jones（现场）</p><p class=\"event-desc\">贾樟柯的《三峡好人》将校园与湾区观众聚在一起，放映后与作家何伟、伯克利学者 Andrew F. Jones 交流。</p></div></div><details class=\"event-details\"><summary>展开详情与图片</summary><div class=\"event-details-content\"><p>《三峡好人》以三峡地区的变迁为背景，跟随寻找亲人的人物，呈现拆迁与重建中的日常生活。大同通过放映和映后对谈，为观众提供从影像与写作经验思考这些变化的空间。</p><p>何伟通过 Zoom 参加映后讨论，Andrew F. Jones 在现场交流。组织者李沛航在次日的感谢邮件中记录，活动吸引了来自湾区的160余位观众，团队还准备向何伟寄送全体签名的感谢卡。</p><p>学社早期档案还记录了2015年对这部影片的一次放映。</p><h4>活动与档案影像</h4><div class=\"event-gallery\"><a href=\"images/events/film-still-life-screening/01.jpg\" data-cap=\"Moffitt 102 放映与交流现场\"><img src=\"images/events/film-still-life-screening/01.jpg\" alt=\"Moffitt 102 放映与交流现场\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/film-still-life-screening/02.jpg\" data-cap=\"映后讨论\"><img src=\"images/events/film-still-life-screening/02.jpg\" alt=\"映后讨论\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/film-still-life-screening/03.jpg\" data-cap=\"伯克利活动现场\"><img src=\"images/events/film-still-life-screening/03.jpg\" alt=\"伯克利活动现场\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/film-still-life-screening/04.jpg\" data-cap=\"活动现场\"><img src=\"images/events/film-still-life-screening/04.jpg\" alt=\"活动现场\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div></div></details></article></section><section class=\"archive-year\" data-year=\"2021\"><h2 class=\"archive-year-heading\">2021</h2><article class=\"event-card public-event\" id=\"2021-chinese-mayor\" data-cat=\"Film &amp; Panel\" data-year=\"2021\"><div class=\"public-event-layout\"><figure class=\"event-cover\"><img src=\"images/events/film-the-chinese-mayor-screening/cover.jpg\" alt=\"原活动海报 · 2021年10月29日\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>原活动海报 · 2021年10月29日</figcaption></figure><div class=\"public-event-copy\"><div class=\"event-meta\"><time datetime=\"2021-10\">2021年10月</time><span class=\"event-tag\">电影与映后</span></div><h3>《中国市长》：纪录片放映与圆桌讨论</h3><p class=\"event-people\">Jean Quan（关丽珍）· Thomas Gold（高棣民）· 主持：Junius Brown</p><p class=\"event-desc\">从纪录片《中国市长》出发，讨论城市重建、地方治理，以及公民与政府之间的关系。</p></div></div><details class=\"event-details\"><summary>展开详情与图片</summary><div class=\"event-details-content\"><p>周浩执导的纪录片记录山西大同的城市改造及其引发的矛盾。大同学社将影片与公共服务、中国政治及社会研究的视角联系起来，邀请嘉宾与观众展开讨论。</p><p>原活动流程列出前奥克兰市长关丽珍、伯克利社会学者高棣民参加圆桌，Junius Brown 主持讨论，Luxi负责开场与现场主持。放映后安排圆桌及观众问答。原主持稿还向 Andrew F. Jones、Annie Campbell Washington 与何老师致谢。</p><p>学社早期档案还记录了2015年对这部影片的一次放映。</p><h4>活动与档案影像</h4><div class=\"event-gallery\"><a href=\"images/events/film-the-chinese-mayor-screening/01.jpg\" data-cap=\"相关放映档案照片 · 拍摄年份待考\"><img src=\"images/events/film-the-chinese-mayor-screening/01.jpg\" alt=\"相关放映档案照片 · 拍摄年份待考\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div></div></details></article><article class=\"event-card public-event\" id=\"2021-76-days\" data-cat=\"Film &amp; Panel\" data-year=\"2021\"><div class=\"public-event-layout public-event-text-only\"><div class=\"public-event-copy\"><div class=\"event-meta\"><time datetime=\"2021-10\">2021年10月</time><span class=\"event-tag\">电影与映后</span></div><h3>《76天》：纪录片展映与讨论</h3><p class=\"event-desc\">放映纪录片《76天》，通过武汉医院中患者与医护人员的故事，回看疫情初期的生活与情感。</p></div></div><details class=\"event-details\"><summary>展开详情</summary><div class=\"event-details-content\"><p>活动预告邀请当时的伯克利政治学博士候选人 Junius Brown，与观众共同参与映后讨论。</p></div></details></article><article class=\"event-card public-event\" id=\"2021-kecheng-fang\" data-cat=\"Lecture\" data-year=\"2021\"><div class=\"public-event-layout\"><figure class=\"event-cover\"><img src=\"images/events/2021-kecheng-fang/title-slide.jpg\" alt=\"原活动开场幻灯片 · 2021 年 4 月\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>原活动开场幻灯片 · 2021 年 4 月</figcaption></figure><div class=\"public-event-copy\"><div class=\"event-meta\"><time datetime=\"2021-04\">2021年4月</time><span class=\"event-tag\">讲座</span></div><h3>方可成：中国媒体格局的变迁</h3><p class=\"event-desc\">方可成参与大同学社线上活动，分享中国媒体格局的变迁，并与观众问答。</p></div></div><details class=\"event-details\"><summary>展开详情与图片</summary><div class=\"event-details-content\"><p>活动结合研究分享、观众提问与讨论。</p><h4>活动与档案影像</h4><div class=\"event-gallery\"><a href=\"images/events/2021-kecheng-fang/speaker-portrait.jpg\" data-cap=\"原活动幻灯片中的嘉宾肖像\"><img src=\"images/events/2021-kecheng-fang/speaker-portrait.jpg\" alt=\"原活动幻灯片中的嘉宾肖像\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div></div></details></article></section><section class=\"archive-year\" data-year=\"2020\"><h2 class=\"archive-year-heading\">2020</h2><article class=\"event-card public-event\" id=\"2020-yiqing-xu\" data-cat=\"Lecture\" data-year=\"2020\"><div class=\"public-event-layout\"><figure class=\"event-cover\"><img src=\"images/events/2020-yiqing-xu/online-discussion.jpg\" alt=\"徐轶青线上活动截图 · 2020 年 10 月\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>徐轶青线上活动截图 · 2020 年 10 月</figcaption></figure><div class=\"public-event-copy\"><div class=\"event-meta\"><time datetime=\"2020-10\">2020年10月</time><span class=\"event-tag\">讲座</span></div><h3>变局中的中国留学生 · 徐轶青</h3><p class=\"event-desc\">徐轶青参与“变局中的中国留学生”线上活动，与同学分享并进行问答。</p></div></div><details class=\"event-details\"><summary>展开详情</summary><div class=\"event-details-content\"><p>活动结合嘉宾分享、观众提问与讨论。</p></div></details></article></section><section class=\"archive-year\" data-year=\"2019\"><h2 class=\"archive-year-heading\">2019</h2><article class=\"event-card public-event\" id=\"2019-embroidery\" data-cat=\"Exhibition\" data-year=\"2019\"><div class=\"public-event-layout\"><figure class=\"event-cover\"><img src=\"images/events/2019-exhibition-sookmyung-embroidery/cover.jpg\" alt=\"学社原有影像档案\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>学社原有影像档案</figcaption></figure><div class=\"public-event-copy\"><div class=\"event-meta\"><time datetime=\"2019\">2019年</time><span class=\"event-tag\">展览</span></div><h3>韩国淑明女子大学汉字刺绣枕顶展Modern Chinese Embroidery on Pillow Covers</h3><p class=\"event-desc\">与淑明女子大学博物馆联合办展——近代中国刺绣枕顶首次公开展出。配套展品清单、志愿者排班、借展协议与讲座海报均由大同学社独立执行，是社团史上规模最大的对外活动。</p></div></div><details class=\"event-details\"><summary>展开详情与图片</summary><div class=\"event-details-content\"><h4>活动与档案影像</h4><div class=\"event-gallery\"><a href=\"images/events/2019-exhibition-sookmyung-embroidery/01.jpg\" data-cap=\"活动档案影像\"><img src=\"images/events/2019-exhibition-sookmyung-embroidery/01.jpg\" alt=\"活动档案影像\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2019-exhibition-sookmyung-embroidery/02.jpg\" data-cap=\"活动档案影像\"><img src=\"images/events/2019-exhibition-sookmyung-embroidery/02.jpg\" alt=\"活动档案影像\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2019-exhibition-sookmyung-embroidery/03.jpg\" data-cap=\"活动档案影像\"><img src=\"images/events/2019-exhibition-sookmyung-embroidery/03.jpg\" alt=\"活动档案影像\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2019-exhibition-sookmyung-embroidery/04.jpg\" data-cap=\"活动档案影像\"><img src=\"images/events/2019-exhibition-sookmyung-embroidery/04.jpg\" alt=\"活动档案影像\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2019-exhibition-sookmyung-embroidery/05.jpg\" data-cap=\"活动档案影像\"><img src=\"images/events/2019-exhibition-sookmyung-embroidery/05.jpg\" alt=\"活动档案影像\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2019-exhibition-sookmyung-embroidery/06.jpg\" data-cap=\"活动档案影像\"><img src=\"images/events/2019-exhibition-sookmyung-embroidery/06.jpg\" alt=\"活动档案影像\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div></div></details></article></section><section class=\"archive-year\" data-year=\"2017\"><h2 class=\"archive-year-heading\">2017</h2><article class=\"event-card public-event\" id=\"2017-hoover-visit\" data-cat=\"Field Trip\" data-year=\"2017\"><div class=\"public-event-layout\"><figure class=\"event-cover\"><img src=\"images/events/2017-field-trip-hoover-archives/cover.jpg\" alt=\"学社原有影像档案\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>学社原有影像档案</figcaption></figure><div class=\"public-event-copy\"><div class=\"event-meta\"><time datetime=\"2017\">2017年</time><span class=\"event-tag\">参访</span></div><h3>Hoover Institution 档案馆参访Stanford Hoover Institution — Archive Visit</h3><p class=\"event-desc\">走进斯坦福胡佛研究所，近距离观看民国时期与现代中国的珍贵档案原件。</p></div></div><details class=\"event-details\"><summary>展开详情与图片</summary><div class=\"event-details-content\"><h4>活动与档案影像</h4><div class=\"event-gallery\"><a href=\"images/events/2017-field-trip-hoover-archives/01.jpg\" data-cap=\"活动档案影像\"><img src=\"images/events/2017-field-trip-hoover-archives/01.jpg\" alt=\"活动档案影像\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2017-field-trip-hoover-archives/02.jpg\" data-cap=\"活动档案影像\"><img src=\"images/events/2017-field-trip-hoover-archives/02.jpg\" alt=\"活动档案影像\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2017-field-trip-hoover-archives/03.jpg\" data-cap=\"活动档案影像\"><img src=\"images/events/2017-field-trip-hoover-archives/03.jpg\" alt=\"活动档案影像\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2017-field-trip-hoover-archives/04.jpg\" data-cap=\"活动档案影像\"><img src=\"images/events/2017-field-trip-hoover-archives/04.jpg\" alt=\"活动档案影像\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div></div></details></article></section><section class=\"archive-year\" data-year=\"2016\"><h2 class=\"archive-year-heading\">2016</h2><article class=\"event-card public-event\" id=\"2016-social-science-salon\" data-cat=\"Salon\" data-year=\"2016\"><div class=\"public-event-layout\"><figure class=\"event-cover\"><img src=\"images/events/2016-salon-social-science/cover.jpg\" alt=\"学社原有影像档案\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>学社原有影像档案</figcaption></figure><div class=\"public-event-copy\"><div class=\"event-meta\"><time datetime=\"2016-09\">2016年9月</time><span class=\"event-tag\">沙龙</span></div><h3>&quot;Let&#x27;s Talk About Social Science&quot;跨学科沙龙 — 历史、社会学、政治学的对话</h3><p class=\"event-desc\">15 位同学围绕&quot;什么是好的社科研究&quot;展开 90 分钟讲读与提问，奠定大同学社小型沙龙的传统。</p></div></div><details class=\"event-details\"><summary>展开详情与图片</summary><div class=\"event-details-content\"><h4>活动与档案影像</h4><div class=\"event-gallery\"><a href=\"images/events/2016-salon-social-science/01.jpg\" data-cap=\"活动档案影像\"><img src=\"images/events/2016-salon-social-science/01.jpg\" alt=\"活动档案影像\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2016-salon-social-science/02.jpg\" data-cap=\"活动档案影像\"><img src=\"images/events/2016-salon-social-science/02.jpg\" alt=\"活动档案影像\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2016-salon-social-science/03.jpg\" data-cap=\"活动档案影像\"><img src=\"images/events/2016-salon-social-science/03.jpg\" alt=\"活动档案影像\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a href=\"images/events/2016-salon-social-science/04.jpg\" data-cap=\"活动档案影像\"><img src=\"images/events/2016-salon-social-science/04.jpg\" alt=\"活动档案影像\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div></div></details></article></section>",
